{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act54side", "eventName": "月行水上", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "SR-5", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "月斜", "storyInfo": "结城理和同伴们在殡仪堂的志愿实践中，进一步了解了吉阿达和裘里奥对于葬礼的分歧。他们还在殡仪堂发现了此前与怪物战斗时遇到的路人的死亡证明，众人陷入焦虑之中，将此事告知了博士……", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g9_gate", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_sys_act16side_intro", "key": "$m_sys_act16side_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#1$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……这里就是今天要实习的地方？我记得是叫安魂殡仪堂……吉阿达小姐和裘里奥先生就是在这里工作吧——", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#1$4"}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#6$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（打哈欠）呼啊……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#6$4"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天夜里那个“告解车”也太能跑了，追了好久才追到……要是能再多睡会就好了。", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$4"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，没想到博士对“长得像告解车的怪物”这么感兴趣，还要我们把见过的怪物外形都整理出来……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$4"}, {"id": 16, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "描述起来还挺麻烦的呢，要是有更会画画的人在就好了。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#4$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#4$5"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……对了，时间好像快到了，是不是该去殡仪堂里面了？说不定吉阿达小姐和裘里奥先生已经在等我们了。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$3"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，走吧。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$5"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "希望今天的实习顺顺利利，也希望那两位今天不要再吵架了……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$3"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 1.0, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.7}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 3.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.01, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 0.01, "fillto": 1.0, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.0}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g6_funeralhome", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 7.0, "fillfrom": 1.0, "fillto": 0.01, "grad": "true", "fadetime": 0.7}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$drift_intro", "key": "$drift_loop", "volume": 0.4}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "人到齐了？那就开始吧。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先和你们交代一下基本的情况。这里是拉特兰的第一座安魂殡仪堂，现在还没有正式开放。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然和安魂教堂的名字相似，但实际上二者的工作有所不同……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "工作重点不一样哦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要插嘴，裘里奥。讲解这部分是我的工作。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然和孩子们说这些有点……不过，是你们自己选择了来这里进行实习，我不会照顾你们的心情。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要以此为工作志愿，接下来的内容就是你们应当了解的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们知道土葬和火葬的区别吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "葬于土中，葬于火中，是对死者遗体的不同处置方式……除此以外的区别是？", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3"}, {"id": 56, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从殡仪从业者的角度讲，这两者区别很大。成本、耗时、流程的复杂程度、对公共设施的要求……都不能同日而语。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉特兰传统的丧葬方式是以安魂教堂系统进行的土葬为主，其他丧葬方式作为补充。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在拉特兰城原本的固定航线停驻点，设有各区安魂教堂来处理包括葬礼和墓地管理在内的事务……目前，这个系统也在继续运行。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而这座殡仪堂……将会是拉特兰在移动城市之内规模化推广火葬的开始。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……在移动城市内进行火葬……那，要怎么扫墓呢……？", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$4"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "殡仪堂中会有安放遗骨的场所以供追思，纪念逝者的活动可以在殡仪堂中进行。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也就是说，殡仪堂相当于是选择了火葬的那些人的墓地……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$4"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐刚才好像有提到，拉特兰的传统方式是土葬吧。第一座安魂殡仪堂……那个，冒昧问一下，为什么会想要新建这样的设施呢？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$4"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……简单来说，根本的原则是：在拉特兰的规则之内，拉特兰人有充分的选择权，而拉特兰城会保障每一位拉特兰公民的权益。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "火葬与土葬一样，是一种合理的选项。殡仪堂之所以建立，是为了让选择这个选项的人能获得更方便的公共服务。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，近来无遗嘱逝者的增加给安魂教堂系统造成了很大压力应该也是一个因素……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但无论是怎样的丧葬方式，都要给死者以尊严，给生者以慰藉，这一点是不会变的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐，我能说话了吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不能。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就一句行吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你说吧。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实不用担心，像哥伦比亚的火葬业就已经很成熟了，不会不方便祭拜——不如说是非常方便！我回来的行李里就带着爸爸的骨灰盒。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "众人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你从没提过这件事。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#6$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一直没拆完行李嘛。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——这算原因？算了……你的私事之后再说。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#12$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "关于殡仪堂，刚才介绍的内容里，大家有什么疑问吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吉阿达小姐刚才说，殡仪堂还没有正式开放，那我们现在要做什么工作呢？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$3"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们只需要跟着我——还有裘里奥先生，熟悉一些流程，做些协助工作就好。毕竟只是实习，不会给你们安排要独自完成的工作的。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至于殡仪堂正式开放……则是在举办完第一场葬礼之后。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也就是你们接下来要参与的工作项目，维韦塔女士的葬礼。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_sys_act16side_intro", "key": "$m_sys_act16side_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "好了，吉阿达带你们看过殡仪堂各类设施的位置，也介绍过准备室的功能了，现在该轮到我了。"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "孩子们，准备好了吗！"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又在主持派对了？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 119, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_370_1#1$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达，司务叫你过去一趟，有新来的案子。", "name": "殡仪堂员工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_370_1#1$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心去吧吉阿达，剩下的我来介绍就可以！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "吉阿达", "content": "很难放心……"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "吉阿达", "content": "没事，我很快就回来。"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实余下的部分也不多了，主要是今天的工作内容……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天我们要过一遍葬礼流程的设计案，确定当天的仪式环节，把还没确定的供应商需求定下来，提交给殡仪堂相关的部门。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在拉特兰真是方便多了，殡仪堂的分发效率很高，明明是刚设立的新部门……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我有疑问。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请讲！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐是殡仪堂的葬礼经纪，我已经了解了。裘里奥先生也是吗？你和她很不一样。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3"}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咦，这么明显？我确实不是葬礼经纪，之前和理说过，好像还没和你们大家讲。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的本职是派对设计师，现在是出于特殊原因暂时在这里工作，和吉阿达一起策划这场葬礼……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，她应该不愿意我这么说。严格来说，我是根据死者——也就是我姨妈——遗嘱中的要求，要在她的葬礼上办一场派对。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使吉阿达不愿意承认，实际操作上，这场“葬礼”和“派对”的很多部分都是重合的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "场地选择、流程设计、设施和物料筹备、规划和邀请宾客、餐饮和音乐的安排……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我要办的这场派对，和吉阿达负责的这场葬礼，在物理层面上就是同一件事啦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$5", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么说……好像也能理解。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$5"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "对吧对吧，吉阿达老是要把这两件事划清界限，"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "裘里奥", "content": "唉……"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达对这场葬礼很紧张……其实我知道的啦，又是她负责的第一场葬礼，又是殡仪堂的第一场葬礼什么的……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥先生很体谅吉阿达小姐的心情呢，为什么平时要那样争执呢……要是两边都能解释清楚，是不是就可以好好相处……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$3"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们真的很担心我和吉阿达呢。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，吉阿达之所以那么紧张，是因为她知道这场葬礼可能意味着什么——", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "新的丧葬方式、黎博利葬礼经纪，乃至这座殡仪堂能不能为拉特兰人所接受。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但正因为是这样……我不明白，难道不更应该尊重拉特兰的传统做法吗？越是翻天覆地的变化，大家才越是难以接受啊。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "葬礼就应该沉默肃穆吗？可葬礼也是许多人相聚的时候，为什么不能是一个共同享受当下的机会？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 171, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "duration": 1.5, "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在葬礼后段加上了卡拉OK接力环节，是出于这种考虑吗？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎呀，你什么时候回来的……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "从“新的丧葬方式和黎博利葬礼经纪能不能被拉特兰人接受”那里。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然了，你说得没错。这场葬礼确实是这样。你做这一切也都是想帮我，你是想说这个吧？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我设计这些内容，也是因为我认为这样会是一场更棒的葬礼。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#8$1"}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以去掉了我原本安排在那里的火化见证和捡骨环节？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是还在商量吗……还是要考虑宾客的心情和氛围吧，有些事会不会太沉重了？一定要在客人们眼前进行吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那如果将这部分改成把骨灰装填进礼炮，邀请宾客亲手把骨灰打上天，你觉得怎么样？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#11$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哇……天才啊吉阿达？！这比卡拉OK接力好多了，还是你专业！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过这样好像要重新排一下时间表，我想想……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别想了。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#9$1"}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……哦，是在开玩笑啊。可这个主意真的很酷……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好吧好吧！今天理也在，晚点一起慢慢讨论？我会认真听所有人的想法的！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#2$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达，你看起来很累，新来的案子很麻烦？忙得过来吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我没事。新案子可以往后安排，只是先去领个材料。", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#1$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那我帮你去把材料放到文件柜？你先休息一下，喝点东西，怎么样~", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥……为什么你都不会生气？", "name": "吉阿达"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2378_1#8$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "啊……不如我们帮吉阿达小姐把文件拿过去吧，你们两位讲解都辛苦了。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4"}, {"id": 217, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$4", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由加莉，只是放两份文件，为什么要让我们所有人都过来？", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3"}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "让他们两人单独相处一下嘛。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不会吵起来吗？他们看起来关系很差。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$3"}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在的话，我觉得不——", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#1$4"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由加莉，你怎么突然愣住……？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$3"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……死亡证明……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这张照片……这是，我们第一天遇见的那个喝醉的路人……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4"}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他……死了？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$4"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g1_dorm", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.4}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "和博士联络过了，博士应该快到了。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "麻烦你了……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一直想着那位死者的事，实习的时候都不知道自己在做什么了……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎么会这样呢……是因为被暗影，不，被怪物触碰了吗……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#2$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使是患上无气力症的人，也不会在这么短的时间内去世呀……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#12$1"}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错。但是我们看到的文件上，并没有写明他的死因，现在还不能确定就是怪物所致。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也可能另有缘故……比如不幸遭遇了事故，或者身患疾病等。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#8$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，你说得对……谢谢你，埃癸斯。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1"}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "晚上好。你们说在殡仪堂实习的时候发现了很严重的事，是什么情况？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是我看到的……我看到了一份，死亡证明。那上面的人……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……就是这样。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "殡仪堂的文件不能带出来，不过，我记下了那个人的名字……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "由加莉在自己的终端上打出那个名字，递给了博士。"}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，我知道了。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天，我也找吉阿达小姐打听一下死者的事吧。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士，能再帮忙确认一件事吗？之前我在靶场遇到的那位女性，她也被怪物触碰过。虽然我不知道她的姓名，但现在的情况令人担忧。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我记得这件事，会一起调查的。不知道名字的话，也许能在靶场的出入记录里找找线索。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另外，我要确认一下——你们在和怪物战斗的过程中，没有像那样接触过怪物吧？身体有没有不适或者异状？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有，我们战斗时很小心。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实大家战斗的时候，我观察到，有时怪物似乎会无视我们。它们好像对拉特兰人更感兴趣……如果可以这么说的话。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它们会被拉特兰人吸引？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不确定……只是，它们那时候的样子确实也不像是从战斗中逃跑……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之后调查时，我再仔细观察一下吧。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$1"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们还打算继续进行夜间调查吗？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……嗯。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还没查明怪物究竟会对拉特兰人造成怎样的伤害，现在只能由我们来消灭它们。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已经不只是无气力症的问题了，想到怪物甚至有可能会害死人……我们是不可能袖手旁观的。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#9$1"}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。我想你们也是不会放弃的。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，在明确死因前，这件事只是巧合的可能性也仍然存在，你们不要给自己太大压力。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对了，今天的实习怎么样呢，还顺利吗？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "山岸风花", "content": "吉阿达小姐和裘里奥先生还是争执不下呢……"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "山岸风花", "content": "不过他们两位对我们都很亲切。"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……对了，想问一下，博士了解殡仪堂的事吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可能不会比在那里实习的你知道得更多，毕竟它还没有正式开放。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐说，殡仪堂的建立是为了在拉特兰这座移动城市之内推广火葬……", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1"}, {"id": 324, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……估计是六厅的什么项目吧。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉特兰的大部分机构都是隶属于教皇厅的公务单位，殡仪堂和安魂教堂都属于民政服务，应该都是由第六厅管辖。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在的拉特兰，确实正在经历一些变化。殡仪堂的出现也是其中的一部分。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这是个脆弱的城市。即使是真正的奇迹，也会因为存在得太久让人忘记了它的本质。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拉特兰正在从梦中醒来。失去了曾经的答案，甚至尚未找到新的问题，但或许每个人都感受到了……某种警示。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在这样的城市里，什么都有可能发生。如果你真的想理解……不如向拉特兰人本身寻求答案。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士不是拉特兰人吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大概不算是吧。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天的事，你们不用太沮丧。如果这例死亡确实与怪物有关，也可能成为查明怪物本质的线索。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 336, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好。如果之后有什么新的发现，我们再和博士你联络。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 338, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}